    "title": "'Kind of a lark' takes Messerschmidt to sports writing HOF - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Anthony Conchel ,\n11 hours ago BUCYRUS (Crawford County Now) — Dan Messerschmidt has covered local sports for nearly four decades and in that time he has written about Hall of Fame athletes and coaches. Recently, the North Central Ohio Media Group Sports Director became one himself, voted to The Ohio Prep Sports Media Association’s Class of 2026 Hall of Fame. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
